TikTok

TikTok’s core is a personalized For You Page (FYP) powered by a highly adaptive algorithm. It immediately shows each user an endless stream of ultra-short videos tailored to their tastes, maximizing watch time. TikTok also offers creative features like Duets and Stitches, which let users remix or react to others’ videos. These collaboration tools boost engagement by allowing direct interaction with trending content
